cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the code, fixtures or analyses, cite Olivia Iarmak and this software repository; identify the exact commit and experiment used. The studies are exploratory, not a validated held-out benchmark."
type: software
title: "LocaleSafe: diagnose language and workflow failures in service agents"
authors:
  - family-names: Iarmak
    given-names: Olivia
repository-code: "https://github.com/oliarmak-web/LocaleSafe-Agent-Eval"
license: MIT
abstract: "Matched multilingual service-agent experiments with sandbox execution and separate handoff, action and monitor scores. Archived exploratory studies include competence screens, oracle controls and post-hoc intervention analyses. Implementation, translations and writing use AI assistance."
